<!-- FUN -->
<section id="for-fun">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <h2>
        What I do when I’m{" "}
        <span class="hl">
          <i>not working</i>
        </span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <!-- Name Cloud, our way: a short story set big; hover a highlighted word
           and it lights up while a small card follows the cursor -->
    <p class="story reveal" id="story">
      When the laptop closes, I open a{" "}
      <span class="hw" data-peek="book">
        <i>book</i>
      </span>
      . Literature has been my quiet teacher since the days I taught myself to
      code. Most of my ideas show up on{" "}
      <span class="hw" data-peek="walk">
        <i>long walks</i>
      </span>
      , not at the desk. I keep life{" "}
      <span class="hw" data-peek="minimal">
        <i>minimal</i>
      </span>
      , and save the best part of the day for{" "}
      <span class="hw" data-peek="galaxy">
        <i>my little galaxy</i>
      </span>
      : a son, a daughter and an amazing family.
    </p>
    <div class="peek" id="peek" aria-hidden="true">
      <img data-k="book" src="/images/staging/reading.jpg" alt="" />
      <img data-k="walk" src="/images/staging/walking.jpg" alt="" />
      <img data-k="minimal" src="/images/staging/minimal.jpg" alt="" />
      <img data-k="galaxy" src="/images/staging/galaxy.jpg" alt="" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
